7909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0802083f/uploads/origins/fb3cb8aa-81dc-424a-af55-8cbfae6c1f8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c140387cae8059d02865a647d4df4065", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0802083f/uploads/origins/fb3cb8aa-81dc-424a-af55-8cbfae6c1f8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0914ed04996da93720c6d46425d5f2a6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "アイドルマスターシャイニーカラーズの和泉愛依の緊縛絵をリクエストします。\n家に強盗が侵入し縄で手足と身体を縛って口にガムテープ貼られた状態でこちらのような状態で監禁されてるという感じで。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/118866062\n\n衣装はこちらでお願いします\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/F0KHupHaUAcojZQ?format=jpg&name=large", "nc": 168, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/58", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/63539444/uploads/origins/0a6e2f3e-17c1-482a-b190-e968b39abb6a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=59ea2fe339fdad17c82b8abdb36bcec4", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/57", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ad9e6a4a/uploads/origins/6da54fa4-b296-4b4a-8585-6d4ed76f7a01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a09ce5e8e3df6e1444672b9df57ef3d0", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 1430645, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/56", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef46277e/uploads/origins/ba3d4552-8f52-44d2-bccc-2754e96dcfd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c581c7be106eeb6d405467ce08dcc966", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef46277e/uploads/origins/ba3d4552-8f52-44d2-bccc-2754e96dcfd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c49508705b1e8797587d2bcf6bcbf7a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "2.5次元の誘惑のリリエルが資料の「監獄とリリエル」に拘束を追加して足にもテープを巻かれて口にガムテープ貼られて監禁されているというのをお願いしたいです\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GUi3V9SWAAAF2uf?format=jpg&name=large", "nc": 56, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/55", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9e549d3/uploads/origins/4b8045f6-660e-4836-981d-31728d220587?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7c67db7564bab5ce33983f0b84d2032", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9e549d3/uploads/origins/4b8045f6-660e-4836-981d-31728d220587?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=de7e1d19a0724ecbf089ff54a5e42a7f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "以前のプリコネの支倉伊緒にメッセージウインドウとセリフを付けたものをお願いします。\nセリフは\n1ページ\n「んぐ…むぐぐ…（た、助けて！）」\n2ページ\n「助けますか？　はい、いいえ」と選択肢が出て、岸君が「いいえ」を選ぶ\n3ページ\n「んぐー！むぐぐーん！（こらー！岸君！）」と怒る\nという感じで", "nc": 171, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/54", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/145a9aaa/uploads/origins/000a13e0-4ce1-4910-a015-42ee8952bbfd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb07650165ebe9c9ac5a92a6e68fa0aa", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 162, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/53", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f79413a6/uploads/origins/4e9bf9b3-cfa0-4416-b82b-5afe4157ca09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8105490d37fed8d316a1020e991972ac", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f79413a6/uploads/origins/4e9bf9b3-cfa0-4416-b82b-5afe4157ca09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d967134169ff4ea1fe9cdeaff0b8021a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "リクエストさせていただきます。\nキャラはドラゴンボールGTのパンで、テープ拘束されて箱に梱包されている姿を希望します。\n\n同イラストで台詞差分として\n・パンの気を感じられず、パンを探す悟空とトランクスの声と、商品ナンバー(パン)を搬入完了し目標の星へシャトル発進をする機械アナウンス\n\n・パンを購入した宇宙人がパンを見て、注文通りで凄く可愛い的な台詞と、パンの名前を確かめてコレクションとして大事にする的な台詞\n\nをお願いします。\nパンの呻き声や擬音はお任せします。\nテープの色は黒かピンクで光沢があるタイプでお願いします。\n\nもしも可能であれば、表情差分や口元のテープなし差分をお願いしたいです。", "nc": 169, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/52", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c476ac54/uploads/origins/9836841e-38c4-4ef3-9a63-2894fd7b5db1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=88ed99b952eb56a51b4fb90017fdb169", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/51", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a9de2c9/uploads/origins/77e92f1a-7a04-4dc3-aafa-048527602bfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6650b6aedfeb114974f459b6a3e6a28c", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 1430645, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@navygag/works/50", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d44e2f06/uploads/origins/eb03d89a-31c7-48b8-b5bd-070616bb9fb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=38977ebddc15db6365bcec3ba1dfebca", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 447909, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": n